# Same six moles and net 200 J per branch, grouped differently.
# Keep v1 empty until it receives the left branch's final mixture.
register lv3
new
add v2 water 1mol
heat v2 300J
new
add v3 water 2mol
cool v3 200J
new
add v4 water 3mol
heat v4 100J
new
mix v2 1 v3 1 into v5
mix v5 1 v4 1 into v1
measure v1 thermometer
new
add v6 water 1mol
heat v6 300J
new
add v7 water 2mol
cool v7 200J
new
add v8 water 3mol
heat v8 100J
new
mix v7 1 v8 1 into v9
new
mix v6 1 v9 1 into v10
measure v10 thermometer
